[step] Intentional socket-head locating seat in the shallow visible-head style Derek requested. The parallel planes are the bezel face and the floor of its counterbore, not a leftover skin or an unintended ledge.
alternatives: Removing the recess omits the requested head seat. A fully buried head changes the visible-head design.
