[thin] The shallow screw seats use the cover and bearing-floor section explicitly included in the proposal Derek approved with "All of that sounds good." This exception belongs to the agreed cover section; it does not apply to the surrounding housing. The native slice deposits the complete bezel as solid stock.
alternatives: Thickening the floor while holding the face and head seat in place deepens the cover and glass seat and reduces the selected screw's insert engagement; preserving engagement requires a different screw or receiver stack. Filling the counterbore removes its locating seat.
